    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Paintballers : MLPB 2025, the groundbreaking cross-platform video game meticulously designed by professional paintball players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-fueled action, realistic environments, and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or a newcomer, Paintballers delivers an authentic and thrilling paintball experience like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintballers : MLPB 2025 offers you : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online 5v5 matches in first person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speedball, woodball and other game formats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training mode to learn the real fields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A realistic movement system with 100% editable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic paintball physics (Velocity, bounces, accuracy, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- World ranking and stats system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Possibility to host your own games via listen and dedicated servers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A free to play experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be updated regulary with new content (fields, gears, equipments).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Paintballers : MLPB 2025, the groundbreaking cross-platform video game meticulously designed by professional paintball players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the adrenaline-fueled action, realistic environments, and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or a newcomer, Paintballers delivers an authentic and thrilling paintball experience like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintballers : MLPB 2025 offers you : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online 5v5 matches in first person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speedball, woodball and other game formats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training mode to learn the real fields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A realistic movement system with 100% editable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic paintball physics (Velocity, bounces, accuracy, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- World ranking and stats system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Possibility to host your own games via listen and dedicated servers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A free to play experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be updated regulary with new content (fields, gears, equipments).</p>",
